> I got one question. What are the Bluetooth Capabilities associated
> with oFono. There is a Bluetooth Utility Plugin present in oFono.

Ofono uses Bluetooth Hands-Free Profile for sending and recording mono
audio to/from a headset.

> However there is another Bluetooth Technology Plugin available in
> Connman. Please help me understand the difference !

Connman sets up a Bluetooth Personal Area Network, i.e. tethers an IP
network over Bluetooth.

